  "content": "<p><strong>本模組曾登上&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.gamesradar.com%252fgames%252fadventure%252fas-the-minecraft-movies-infamous-chicken-jockey-scene-continues-going-viral-creative-fans-are-bashing-in-the-chaos-with-film-accurate-skins-and-silly-mods%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GAMESRADAR</a> 專題報導</strong></p><p><strong>需要&nbsp;<a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jockey-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Jockey API</a> 支援</strong></p><p>本模組靈感源自《當個創世神》電影，讓幼年殭屍會主動尋找附近的雞隻並騎乘其上。支援殭屍、殭屍村民、屍殼、殭屍豬布林等所有變種！擊敗後會掉落「熔岩雞」唱片（適用 1.21.8+ 版本）。</p><h2>其他騎乘模組</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bedrock-jockey\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">基岩騎士</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dolphin-jockey\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">海豚騎士</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spider-jockey\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">蜘蛛騎士</a></li>\n</ul>",
